      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense for the debate. to make the argument even more persuasive, how can i frame the idea that these transitions—like moving from traditional tribal or local structures to these centralized systems—were actually a necessary step in \"civilizing\" the economic landscape? like, how can i argue that the local systems weren't really capable of supporting a modern global economy without that external intervention?",
